:: Deadwood Coin Cave
<<location 'island'>><<set $outside to 0>><<effects>><<deadwood-coin-context>>
<<if $nextPassage or $nextPassageCheck>>
  <span id='next'><<lanLink ['Next', '继续'] 'Deadwood Coin Cave'>><</lanLink>></span><<nexttext>><<exit>>
<</if>>
<<if !_coinReady or !_coinCave.found or $combat>>
  <<lanSwitch 'You cannot explore the cavern just now.' '你现在无法探索洞窟。'>><br><br>
  <<if $combat>><<lanLink ['Continue the encounter', '继续遭遇'] 'Deadwood Coin Cave Fight'>><</lanLink>>
  <<else>><<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Return', '返回'] 'Island'>><</lanLink>><</if>><<exit>>
<</if>>
<<if _coinCave.together>><<npc 'Zephyr'>><<person1>><</if>>
<<if $stress gte $stressmax or $hunger gte 2000>>
  <<lanSwitch 'You can no longer concentrate on the passages. You need to get out.' '你已经无法集中精神辨认通道，需要先离开这里。'>><br><br>
  <<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Follow your marks back to the entrance (0:20)', '沿记号退回洞口 (0:20)'] 'Deadwood Coin Cave'>><<deadwood-coin-cave-move 'mouth' 20>><</lanLink>><br>
  <<if _coinCave.room isnot 'mouth'>><<exit>><</if>>
<</if>>

<<if _coinCave.room isnot 'mouth'>>
  <<caveicon 'torch'>><<lanSwitch 'Torchlight: ' '火光：'>>
  <<if _coinCave.torch gte 70>><span class='green'><<lanSwitch 'Bright' '明亮'>></span>
  <<elseif _coinCave.torch gte 35>><span class='lblue'><<lanSwitch 'Waning' '渐弱'>></span>
  <<elseif _coinCave.torch gt 0>><span class='pink'><<lanSwitch 'Flickering' '即将熄灭'>></span>
  <<else>><span class='purple'><<lanSwitch 'Extinguished' '已经熄灭'>></span><</if>><br><br>
<</if>>

<<switch _coinCave.scene>>
  <<case 'wind'>><<lanSwitch 'A draught flattens the flame. You shield the torch until it steadies.' '一阵穿堂风压低了火苗。你护住火把，等火光重新稳住。'>>
  <<case 'trap_seen'>><<lanSwitch 'You spot a taut cord crossing the passage and step over it.' '你看见一根绷紧的细绳横在路上，小心跨了过去。'>>
  <<case 'trip'>><<lanSwitch 'Your foot catches on a loose stone. You strike your knee against the wall.' '松动的石头绊住了你的脚，你的膝盖撞上石壁。'>>
  <<case 'whispers'>><span @class="basicHypnoCss()"><<lanSwitch 'Hollow whispers seem to seep through the cold rock, brushing against your ears like damp breath. When you freeze to listen, the muttering dissolves into the hollow rhythm of dripping water.' '空洞的低语仿佛正从冰冷的岩壁缝隙中渗出，如潮湿的吐息般拂过你的耳畔。你屏息停步细听，那呢喃声却又倏然消散，只余下水珠滴落空洞水洼的回响。'>></span>
  <<case 'tracks'>><<lanSwitch 'A line of old boot prints ends beside the wall. There is no doorway there.' '一串旧靴印在墙边断了。那里并没有门。'>>
  <<case 'captain'>><<lanSwitch "Zephyr examines a mark cut into the wall. \"Old unloading place. Watch your step, and remember the way back.\"" '泽菲尔凑近查看岩壁上的刻痕。“旧卸货点。小心脚下，记住回去的路。”'>>
  <<case 'water_safe'>><<lanSwitch 'You keep the torch above the water and reach the far ledge.' '你将火把举出水面，顺利爬上对岸。'>>
  <<case 'water_wet'>><<lanSwitch 'Your footing gives way. You reach the ledge, but water drenches the torch.' '脚下突然一滑。你抓住了对岸，火把却浸进水里，发出一声轻响。'>>
  <<case 'climb_safe'>><<lanSwitch 'You find firm holds in the rock and cross without touching the water.' '你抓住岩缝里的着力点，沿着石壁越过积水。'>>
  <<case 'climb_fall'>><<lanSwitch 'A hold crumbles. You land in the shallows and drag yourself onto the ledge.' '抓住的石块碎了。你跌进浅水，摸着石壁爬上岸。'>>
  <<case 'notes' 'notes_careful' 'notes_deep'>><<lanSwitch "The last few lines of the notebook are faded: \"Put my share back. Still no pulse. The captain kept his. Every coin has to go back. Until then, none of us can leave.\"" '笔记的最后几行几乎看不清了：“我的那份还回去了。还是没有心跳。船长留着他的分成。全部放回去才行。少一枚，我们谁也走不了。”'>>
  <<case 'writing' 'writing_careful' 'writing_deep'>><<lanSwitch 'The carvings show coins leaving the chest and the bearers turning into skeletons. A final row shows every coin returned, and the figures with flesh again.' '图案中的人影带走金币，接着变成了骷髅。最后一排，金币全数回到箱中，那些人也恢复了血肉。'>>
  <<case 'fuel'>><<lanSwitch 'A dry strip of waxed cloth catches, feeding the flame.' '干燥的蜡布烧了起来，火苗重新窜高。'>>
  <<case 'first_gold'>>
    <<lanSwitch 'The coin is unnaturally cold against your palm, sending a piercing chill through your marrow. <span @class="basicHypnoCss()">Your chest seizes with sudden pressure, and then—your heart simply falls still. You feel for your pulse against wrist and neck. There is nothing. Not a single beat.</span>' '金币贴着掌心，透骨的阴寒直刺骨髓。<span @class="basicHypnoCss()">你的胸口骤然一紧，随即——心脏彻底停跳了。你将手指按上手腕与脖颈。没有脉搏，哪怕一丝跳动都不复存在。</span>'>>
    <<if _coinCave.together and _coinCave.zephyrCoins gt 0>><<lanSwitch 'Zephyr pockets three coins, then stops and presses a hand to <<his>> chest. "What the hell was that?"' '泽菲尔把三枚金币收进钱袋，忽然停住，伸手按着胸口。“他妈的……刚才那是什么？”'>><</if>>
  <<case 'more_gold'>><<lanSwitch 'You pocket more coins. They burn with the same bone-deep frost. <span @class="basicHypnoCss()">Your heart remains entirely motionless, trapped in the phantom cold of the curse.</span>' '你又收起几枚金币，每一枚都散发着同样刺骨的阴冷。<span @class="basicHypnoCss()">你的胸膛里依然一片死寂，彻底困在诅咒的幽灵寒意之中。</span>'>>
  <<case 'part_returned'>><<lanSwitch 'The coins clink against the bottom of the chest. You wait, but nothing changes. Some of the gold is still missing.' '金币落进石箱，发出几声轻响。你等了一会儿，身体却毫无变化。还有取走的金币没有归还。'>>
  <<case 'cured' 'cured_together'>>
    <<lanSwitch 'The last coin falls into place. A sudden violent thud thumps inside your chest, then again—a fierce rhythm surges. You draw a shaky breath as stinging warmth rushes back into your fingers and limbs. The damp air tastes of salt and stone, sharp and real. This time, you can truly taste it.' '最后一枚金币落回箱中。沉寂已久的胸口猛地跳了一下，紧接着又是重重的一记——强劲的搏动重新苏醒。你颤抖着大口喘息，滚烫的暖意奔涌回指尖与四肢。潮湿的空气中带着盐与石头的咸涩，刺鼻却无比真实。这一次，你真真切切地尝到了。'>>
    <<if _coinCave.together and _coinCave.scene is 'cured_together'>><<lanSwitch 'Zephyr gasps and presses a hand to <<his>> throat. "Bloody hell... got me pulse back." <<He>> takes a gulp from <<his>> flask, winces, then laughs. "Now that\'s rum." <<He>> ties the empty pouch shut and steps away from the chest. "Nobody touches the rest."' '泽菲尔倒吸一口气，伸手摸向喉咙。“操……老子又有心跳了。”<<He>>仰头灌了口酒，被呛得皱起脸，随后笑了起来。“这他妈才是酒。”<<He>>扎紧空钱袋，退离石箱。“剩下的谁也不许碰。”'>><</if>>
  <<case 'slipped'>><<lanSwitch 'You slip past while the figure faces the other way, marking a route behind the broken pillars.' '趁那道人影转过身，你贴着墙溜了过去，并记住了断柱后的小路。'>>
  <<case 'caught'>><<lanSwitch 'Your boot scrapes the stone. The figure turns towards you.' '你的鞋底擦响了石头。那道人影转向了你。'>>
  <<case 'won'>><<lanSwitch 'The guard falls behind a broken pillar. Its fingers twitch in the dust, but the way is clear.' '守卫倒在断柱后，手指仍在尘土中抽动。它已经挡不住你了。'>>
  <<case 'permitted'>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        You open your hands and approach as the carved figures do. The guard raises its free hand, palm towards the chest, and steps aside. You pass within reach of the rusted blade. It does not move.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        你摊开双手，照着石刻中人影的样子走近。守卫抬起空着的手，掌心朝向石箱，慢慢让到一旁。你从锈刀旁走过，它没有再动。
    <</language>>
  <<case 'retreated'>><<lanSwitch 'You retreat along your marks. The guard stops at the edge of the firelight.' '你沿着记号退了出来。守卫在洞口的火光外停下，没有继续追赶。'>>
<</switch>>
<<if ['notes_careful', 'writing_careful'].includes(_coinCave.scene)>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      You compare the warnings with what you have seen. The dripping water distracts you, but you find your place and keep reading.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你把记载与眼前的东西逐一对照。滴水声不时打断思绪，但你总能找到刚才读到的地方。
  <</language>>
<<elseif _coinCave.scene is 'notes_deep'>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      You follow the last cramped line with a finger and read it aloud. You hear breathing beneath the bunk. You hold your breath, but the sound continues. Following it towards the wall, you find a narrow passage behind the rotten boards. Dry footprints lead towards the arch, above the flooded crossing. You mark the way.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你指着最后一行潦草的字，念出声来。铺位底下传来呼吸声。你屏住气等着，那声音却没有停。你循声摸向墙边，在腐烂的木板后找到一道窄缝。干燥的脚印通向拱门，恰好绕过下方的积水。你记下了这条路。
  <</language>>
<<elseif _coinCave.scene is 'writing_deep'>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      You follow the carved figures with your fingertips, then press your hand into the last hollow palm. The stone closes cold around your fingers. You wrench them away. In the torchlight, the carved hand is flat again. Beyond the arch, the guard opens its free hand towards the chest. You look back at the figures. Each approaches with open hands.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你用指尖描过石刻上的人影，最后将手按进凹陷的掌印。冰冷的石头忽然收紧，握住了你的手指。你猛地抽回手。火光下，那只石手又摊平了。拱门后的守卫也张开空着的手，朝向石箱。你回头细看，那些人影走近时，全都摊着双手。
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<<if _coinCave.scene>><br><br><</if>>

<<switch _coinCave.room>>
  <<case 'mouth'>>
    <<lanSwitch 'Steps descend from the roots into a dry chamber. An iron brazier burns in a niche. Beside it stand several charred sticks wrapped in cloth. The passage beyond is dark.' '台阶从树根间通进一间干燥的石室。壁龛里的铁火盆仍在燃烧，旁边靠着几根裹布的焦木棍。再往里便是一片漆黑。'>><br><br>
    <<if $stress lt $stressmax and $hunger lt 2000>>
    <<caveicon 'torch'>><<lanLink ['Light a torch at the brazier (0:05)', '借火盆点燃火把 (0:05)'] 'Deadwood Coin Cave'>>
      <<deadwood-coin-context>><<if _coinReady and !$combat and _coinCave.room is 'mouth'>>
        <<set _coinCave.torch to 100, _coinCave.scene to ''>><<island_pass 5>>
      <</if>>
    <</lanLink>><br>
    <<deadwood-coin-cave-route `['Enter the passage (0:10)', '走进通道 (0:10)']` 'passage' 10>>
    <<if _coinCave.shortcut>><<deadwood-coin-cave-route `['Follow the marked dry passage (0:15)', '沿记好的干路深入洞窟 (0:15)']` `_coinCave.guardian is 'cleared' ? 'vault' : 'writing'` 15>><</if>>
    <</if>>
    <br>
    <<getouticon>><<lanLink `_coinCave.voyage ? ['Return to the boat (0:20)', '回到船上 (0:20)'] : ['Return to camp (0:20)', '回到营地 (0:20)']` 'Deadwood Coin Cave Leave'>>
      <<deadwood-coin-context>><<if _coinReady and !$combat>>
        <<if _coinCave.together and _coinCave.zephyrCoins gte 3 and _coinCave.crewCoins is 0 and _coinCave.returns is 0 and !_coinCave.agreed and !(_coinCave.journal or _coinCave.inscription or _coinCave.appraised)>>
          <<set _coinCave.zephyrCoins -= 2, _coinCave.crewCoins to 2, _coinCave.scene to 'distributed'>>
        <<else>><<set _coinCave.scene to ''>><</if>>
        <<set _coinCave.together to false>>
        <<if _coinCave.voyage>><<pass 20>><<else>><<island_pass 20>><<island_explore_end>><</if>>
      <</if>>
    <</lanLink>><br>
  <<case 'passage'>>
    <<lanSwitch 'Rusty rings line the wall. One branch leads past a collapsed sleeping platform; water laps at the steps of the other.' '生锈的铁环沿着石壁排开。一条岔路通向塌掉的铺位，另一条通向被水淹没的台阶。'>><br><br>
    <<deadwood-coin-cave-route `['Head towards the old camp (0:05)', '走向旧营地 (0:05)']` 'camp' 5>>
    <<deadwood-coin-cave-route `['Follow the steps down (0:10)', '沿台阶下去 (0:10)']` 'water' 10>>
    <<deadwood-coin-cave-route `['Return to the entrance (0:10)', '退回洞口 (0:10)']` 'mouth' 10>>
  <<case 'camp'>>
    <<lanSwitch 'A mouldy blanket hangs over a broken bunk. An oilskin notebook lies underneath. Someone has counted days on the wall with a knife. Beside the marks are the words: "Still cold."' '发霉的毯子搭在破木铺上，底下压着一本包着油布的笔记本。有人用刀在墙上划了许多计日的记号，旁边刻着几个字：“还是冷的。”'>><br><br>
    <<if _coinCave.torch gte 20>>
      <<if !_coinCave.journal>>
        <<icon 'library.png'>><<lanLink ['Read the notebook (0:10)', '翻阅笔记 (0:10)'] 'Deadwood Coin Cave'>><<deadwood-coin-read 'journal' 'plain'>><</lanLink>><br>
        <<if maplebirch.get('Psyche')?.active>>
          <<if maplebirch.get('Psyche').state.sanity gte 600>>
            <<investigateicon>><<lanLink ['Read carefully and compare the camp (0:20)', '对照营地仔细读一遍 (0:20)'] 'Deadwood Coin Cave'>><<deadwood-coin-read 'journal' 'careful'>><</lanLink>><<if maplebirch.get('Psyche').state.sanity lt 900>><<willpowerdifficulty 400 400>><</if>><br>
          <</if>>
          <<icon 'library.png'>><<lanLink ['Read the last entry aloud (0:10)', '念出最后一篇记载 (0:10)'] 'Deadwood Coin Cave'>><<deadwood-coin-read 'journal' 'deep'>><</lanLink>><<llsanity>><<ggfear>><br>
        <</if>>
      <</if>>
      <<if !_coinCave.visited.includes('fuel')>><<caveicon 'torch'>><<lanLink ['Feed the torch with the dry waxed cloth (0:05)', '用干蜡布添旺火把 (0:05)'] 'Deadwood Coin Cave'>>
        <<deadwood-coin-context>><<if _coinReady and !$combat and _coinCave.room is 'camp' and !_coinCave.visited.includes('fuel')>>
          <<set _coinCave.visited.pushUnique('fuel'), _coinCave.torch to Math.min(100, _coinCave.torch + 35), _coinCave.scene to 'fuel'>><<deadwood-coin-cave-time 5>>
        <</if>>
      <</lanLink>><br><</if>>
    <<else>><span class='purple'><<lanSwitch 'You need more light to examine what is left here.' '这里太暗了，无法仔细查看留下的东西。'>></span><br><</if>>
    <<deadwood-coin-cave-route `['Return to the fork (0:05)', '返回岔路 (0:05)']` 'passage' 5>>
  <<case 'water'>>
    <<lanSwitch 'Black water fills the lower passage. You can feel a ledge under the surface. Holds in the wall offer another way across.' '黑水淹没了下层通道。水下能踩到一道窄台，墙上的岩缝也许能让你攀过去。'>><br><br>
    <<if !pcAreArmsBound('any')>>
    <<for _crossing range ['swim', 'climb']>><<capture _crossing>>
      <<caveicon 'east'>><<lanLink `_crossing is 'swim' ? ['Wade across with the torch held high (0:10)', '举高火把涉水过去 (0:10)'] : ['Climb along the wall (0:10)', '攀着石壁过去 (0:10)']` 'Deadwood Coin Cave'>>
        <<deadwood-coin-context>><<if _coinReady and !$combat and _coinCave.room is 'water' and !pcAreArmsBound('any')>>
          <<set _coinCrossMaximum to Math.max(400, 1000 - _coinCave.torch * 3 - (_coinCave.together ? 150 : 100))>>
          <<silently>>
            <<if _crossing is 'swim'>><<swimmingdifficulty 1 _coinCrossMaximum 'silent'>><<set _coinCrossed to $swimmingSuccess>>
            <<else>><<athleticsdifficulty 1 _coinCrossMaximum 'silent'>><<set _coinCrossed to $athleticsSuccess>><</if>>
          <</silently>>
          <<deadwood-coin-cave-move 'writing' 10>>
          <<set _coinCave.scene to _crossing is 'swim' ? (_coinCrossed ? 'water_safe' : 'water_wet') : (_coinCrossed ? 'climb_safe' : 'climb_fall')>>
          <<if !_coinCrossed>><<set _coinCave.torch to Math.max(0, _coinCave.torch - 35)>><<stress 6>><<if _crossing is 'climb'>><<pain 4>><</if>><</if>>
          <<if _crossing is 'climb'>><<athletics 1>><<else>><<swimmingskilluse>><</if>>
        <</if>>
      <</lanLink>><<if _crossing is 'swim'>><<swimmingdifficulty 1 `Math.max(400, 1000 - _coinCave.torch * 3 - (_coinCave.together ? 150 : 100))`>><<else>><<athleticsdifficulty 1 `Math.max(400, 1000 - _coinCave.torch * 3 - (_coinCave.together ? 150 : 100))`>><</if>><br>
    <</capture>><</for>>
    <<else>><span class='purple'><<lanSwitch 'Your bound arms make the crossing unsafe. The dry passage remains open.' '胳膊受缚，不便涉水或攀爬。你仍可沿干路绕行。'>></span><br><</if>>
    <<deadwood-coin-cave-route `['Follow the longer dry passage (0:25)', '沿干燥的长路绕行 (0:25)']` 'writing' 25>>
    <<deadwood-coin-cave-route `['Return to the fork (0:10)', '退回岔路 (0:10)']` 'passage' 10>>
  <<case 'writing'>>
    <<lanSwitch 'Stone steps rise out of the water. Carvings cover the archway ahead: open hands, a stone chest, and people carrying coins away. Each of the people has a skull for a face.' '石阶从积水中伸出。前方拱门上刻着张开的手掌、一只石箱，还有带走金币的人影。每个人的脸都是一颗骷髅头。'>><br><br>
    <<if _coinCave.torch gte 20 and !_coinCave.inscription>>
      <<icon 'coin-cave/carvings.png'>><<lanLink ['Examine the carvings (0:10)', '查看刻字与图案 (0:10)'] 'Deadwood Coin Cave'>><<deadwood-coin-read 'inscription' 'plain'>><</lanLink>><br>
      <<if maplebirch.get('Psyche')?.active>>
        <<if maplebirch.get('Psyche').state.sanity gte 600>>
          <<investigateicon>><<lanLink ['Compare the warnings and figures (0:20)', '对照刻字仔细查看 (0:20)'] 'Deadwood Coin Cave'>><<deadwood-coin-read 'inscription' 'careful'>><</lanLink>><<if maplebirch.get('Psyche').state.sanity lt 900>><<willpowerdifficulty 400 400>><</if>><br>
        <</if>>
        <<icon 'coin-cave/carvings.png'>><<lanLink ['Trace the figures with your hand (0:10)', '伸手沿着人影描下去 (0:10)'] 'Deadwood Coin Cave'>><<deadwood-coin-read 'inscription' 'deep'>><</lanLink>><<llsanity>><<ggfear>><br>
      <</if>>
    <</if>>
    <<if currentSkillValue('history') gte 500 and _coinCave.inscription>><span class='green'><<lanSwitch 'History: an old delivery mark shows a dry route back to the entrance.' '历史知识：你认出一处旧卸货标记，记下了返回洞口的干燥近路。'>></span><br><</if>>
    <<if _coinCave.guardian is 'cleared'>>
      <<deadwood-coin-cave-route `['Enter the chamber (0:05)', '进入石室 (0:05)']` 'vault' 5>>
    <<else>>
      <<lanSwitch 'A pale figure stands beyond the arch, one hand resting on a rusted blade. It turns whenever you move towards the chest.' '拱门后站着一道人影，苍白的手按着锈刀。每当你走向石箱，它就跟着转过身。'>><br><br>
      <<if _coinCave.visited.includes('inscription_deep') and !pcAreArmsBound('any')>>
        <<socialiseicon 'ask'>><<lanLink ['Approach with open hands, as in the carvings (0:05)', '摊开双手，照石刻中的样子走过去 (0:05)'] 'Deadwood Coin Cave'>>
          <<deadwood-coin-context>>
          <<if _coinReady and !$combat and $location is 'island' and _coinCave.room is 'writing' and _coinCave.guardian isnot 'cleared' and _coinCave.visited.includes('inscription_deep') and !pcAreArmsBound('any')>>
            <<deadwood-coin-cave-time 5>><<deadwood-coin-context>>
            <<if _coinReady and !$combat and $location is 'island' and _coinCave.room is 'writing' and _coinCave.guardian isnot 'cleared' and !pcAreArmsBound('any')>>
              <<set _coinCave.guardian to 'cleared', _coinCave.room to 'vault', _coinCave.scene to 'permitted', _coinCave.shortcut to true>>
              <<run _coinCave.visited.pushUnique('vault')>>
            <</if>>
          <</if>>
        <</lanLink>><br>
      <</if>>
      <<icon 'alert.png'>><<lanLink ['Force your way through', '打过去'] 'Deadwood Coin Cave Fight'>>
        <<deadwood-coin-cave-combat-start>>
      <</lanLink>><br>
      <<sneakicon>><<lanLink ['Slip behind the pillars (0:10)', '从石柱后绕过去 (0:10)'] 'Deadwood Coin Cave'>>
        <<deadwood-coin-context>><<if _coinReady and !$combat and _coinCave.room is 'writing'>>
          <<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 400>><<skulduggerycheck 'silent'>><<skulduggeryuse>>
          <<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>><<set _coinCave.guardian to 'cleared', _coinCave.room to 'vault', _coinCave.scene to 'slipped'>>
          <<else>><<set _coinCave.scene to 'caught'>><<stress 6>><</if>>
          <<deadwood-coin-cave-time 10>>
        <</if>>
      <</lanLink>><<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 400>><<skulduggerydifficulty>><br>
    <</if>>
    <<deadwood-coin-cave-route `['Take the dry passage back (0:25)', '沿干路退回岔路 (0:25)']` 'passage' 25>>
  <<case 'vault'>>
    <<if _coinCave.guardian isnot 'cleared'>><<deadwood-coin-cave-route `['Return to the arch', '返回拱门']` 'writing' 0>><<exit>><</if>>
    <<lanSwitch 'An open stone chest stands in the middle of the chamber. Dull gold coins lie inside, each stamped with a skull. Behind it, narrow steps lead up towards daylight.' '石室中央放着一只敞开的石箱。暗金色的古币堆在箱底，每枚都刻着骷髅头。箱后有一道窄梯，通向岩顶透着天光的裂缝。'>><br><br>
    <<if _coinCave.together and !_coinCave.bound and (_coinCave.journal or _coinCave.inscription or _coinCave.appraised or _coinCave.returns gt 0)>>
      <<lanSwitch 'Zephyr keeps clear of the chest. "Not taking a share of that. You heard the warning."' '泽菲尔站在石箱旁，没有伸手。“这份老子不要。警告，你也听见了。”'>><br><br>
    <</if>>
    <<set _coinShare to _coinCave.together and !_coinCave.bound and _coinCave.returns is 0 and !(_coinCave.journal or _coinCave.inscription or _coinCave.appraised)>>
    <<if _coinCave.coins + _coinCave.zephyrCoins + _coinCave.museumCoins + _coinCave.crewCoins lt (882 - (_coinShare ? 3 : 0)) and !pcAreArmsBound('both')>>
      <<for _takeCount range [1, 3]>><<capture _takeCount>>
        <<antiqueicon 'cursed-coin'>><<lanLink `_takeCount is 1 ? [_coinShare ? 'Take one coin and share the gold with Zephyr' : 'Take one coin', _coinShare ? '拿走一枚金币，与泽菲尔分取藏金' : '拿走一枚金币'] : [_coinShare ? 'Take a handful and share the gold with Zephyr' : 'Take a handful of coins', _coinShare ? '拿走一把金币，与泽菲尔分取藏金' : '拿走一把金币']` 'Deadwood Coin Cave'>><<deadwood-coin-take _takeCount>><</lanLink>><br>
      <</capture>><</for>>
    <</if>>
    <<if _coinCave.bound and (_coinCave.coins gt 0 or _coinCave.together and _coinCave.agreed and _coinCave.zephyrCoins gt 0)>>
      <<icon 'coin-cave/stone-chest.png'>><<lanLink `_coinCave.together and _coinCave.agreed ? ['Return both shares to the chest (0:05)', '与泽菲尔把双方的金币放回石箱 (0:05)'] : ['Put your coins back in the chest (0:05)', '将自己携带的金币放回石箱 (0:05)']` 'Deadwood Coin Cave'>><<deadwood-coin-return>><</lanLink>><br>
    <</if>>
    <<if _coinCave.bound and _coinCave.zephyrCoins gt 0 and !_coinCave.agreed>><<lanSwitch 'Zephyr still has a share. You will have to settle that with the captain.' '泽菲尔还留着一份。你需要先与船长谈妥。'>><br><</if>>
    <<if _coinCave.bound and _coinCave.museumCoins gt 0>><<lanSwitch 'Winter still has the loaned coins.' '还有金币借展在温特那里。'>><br><</if>>
    <<if _coinCave.bound and _coinCave.crewCoins gt 0>><<lanSwitch 'Some of the gold is still with the crew. Zephyr must call those shares back.' '船员手里还有金币，需要泽菲尔召回。'>><br><</if>>
    <<if _coinCave.together>><<deadwood-coin-zephyr-link>><</if>>
    <<deadwood-coin-cave-route `['Follow the stairs back to the entrance (0:15)', '沿石梯返回洞口 (0:15)']` 'mouth' 15>>
<</switch>>

:: Deadwood Coin Cave Leave
<<deadwood-coin-context>>
<<if $nextPassage or $nextPassageCheck>>
  <span id='next'><<lanLink ['Next', '继续'] 'Deadwood Coin Cave Leave'>><</lanLink>></span><<nexttext>><<exit>>
<</if>>
<<if _coinCave?.voyage>>
  <<if _coinCave.scene is 'distributed'>>
    <<lanSwitch 'On the way back, Zephyr gives a coin each to the sailors who rowed the boat. "Your share. Everyone gets their cut." They pocket the gold, then rub their hands as their fingers grow cold.' '返航时，泽菲尔给两名划船的水手各抛去一枚金币。“你们的分成，出了力就有份。”他们笑着收下，没多久便开始搓手，手指渐渐发白。'>><br><br>
  <</if>>
  <<lanSwitch 'The sailors bring the boat alongside the ship. Zephyr climbs the ladder and orders the anchor raised. You can speak to the captain when you want to return to the mainland.' '水手把小艇划回船边。泽菲尔攀上绳梯，吩咐船员起锚。想回大陆时，可以再去找船长。'>><br><br>
  <<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Return to the deck', '返回甲板'] 'Pirate Deck'>>
    <<if _coinReady and !$combat>><<set $MoreTransformations.treasure.voyage to false, $location to 'pirate_ship', $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</if>>
  <</lanLink>>
<<else>>
  <<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Return to camp', '回到营地'] 'Island'>><</lanLink>>
<</if>><br>
